    "question": {
      ":question/id": "9b9fccfa-25aa-58a8-a24b-8aa1adf11a10",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\operatorname{csc}⁡x?$ Assume $n$ is an integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $y=1$ is the minimum value of the function.\n- **II.** $x=19\\pi $ is a vertical asymptote of the function.\n- **III.** The function takes the value $-1$ at $x=-\\frac{\\pi }{2}+2n\\pi .$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
