    "question": {
      ":question/id": "3153df88-6309-5b8d-ade3-dc9299da00ae",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\operatorname{csc}⁡x?$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The range of the function is all real numbers.\n- **II.** $\\operatorname{csc}⁡(x)=\\operatorname{csc}⁡(x-10\\pi ).$\n- **III.** $x=-15\\pi $ is in the domain of the function.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "8a97fc9d-9487-504a-960d-3b8cb6aeefb6",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "944a05cb-3594-5076-85af-180645648063",
