    "question": {
      ":question/id": "a2ea2cb7-27ee-514d-825e-e075f473b4bd",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y = \\csc x$? Assume $n$ is an integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The point $(-6π,-1)$ is not on the graph.\n- **II.** The function has a vertical asymptotes at $x = nπ$.\n- **III.** The value $y = 2$ is in the range of the function.",
